<title>USA: TABLE - First Banks net income $7.9 mln.</title>
<headline>TABLE - First Banks net income $7.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.22		    $0.11</p>
<p> Net			    796			438</p>
