<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The company had net interest income of $3.8 millon compared to $2.5 million for the quarter, and $7.4 million compared to $5.1 million for the year.</p>
<p>The company said its earnings reflect the expected impact of Sunrise Bank, which was acquired November 1996.</p>
